@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@
+# demo-operator
+
+Pattern: operator (operator), parent chart `charts/addons`. Scaffolded with:
+
+```bash
+homelab scaffold app demo-operator --pattern operator --chart-repo https://charts.example.com/demo --chart-version 1.0.0 --crd-group demo.example.com --crd-kinds Widget,Gadget --huge-crds
+```
+
+## Generated
+
+| Path | Purpose |
+|------|---------|
+| `charts/addons/templates/demo-operator.yaml` | ArgoCD Application(s): demo-operator |
+| `charts/addons/values.yaml` | placeholder values block |
+| `charts/bootstrap/files/health/demo.example.com_Gadget.lua` | ArgoCD health Lua |
+| `charts/bootstrap/files/health/demo.example.com_Widget.lua` | ArgoCD health Lua |
+| `configuration/templates/helm-addons.tmpl` | values for every environment (version, sizing, hostname, smoke URL) |
+| `configuration/versions.yaml` | chart version with its Renovate marker |
+| `tests/e2e/demo-operator/chainsaw-test.yaml` | chainsaw e2e test |
+| `tests/gitops/crd-providers.yaml` | CRD provider for demo.example.com |
+| `tests/gitops/huge-crd-charts.yaml` | requires ServerSideApply (oversized CRDs) |
+| `tests/health/demo.example.com_Gadget/` | health Lua fixtures |
+| `tests/health/demo.example.com_Widget/` | health Lua fixtures |
+| `tests/schemas/sources.yaml` | CRD schema source (`task schemas:vendor`) |
+
+## Before the first PR
+
+- [ ] Adapt the `values:` block in `configuration/templates/helm-addons.tmpl` to the chart's own values
+- [ ] `task schemas:vendor -- --only demo-operator` before rendering any demo.example.com resource; add `helmArgs` in `tests/schemas/sources.yaml` if the chart gates its CRDs behind a value
+- [ ] Check the Ready-condition health Lua fits how the operator reports status (`task test:health`)
+- [ ] Seed any Secret 1Password provides in homelab in `localdev/fakes/secrets.yaml`
+- [ ] Replace this checklist with what the app does and how to operate it
+
+## Verify
+
+```bash
+task verify:text                                   # level 0
+task localdev:up && task verify:text LEVEL=2       # Kind: Healthy + Succeeded, e2e
+task test:e2e -- --test-dir tests/e2e/demo-operator
+```
